stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> unclaimed
  unclaimed --> mounting: claim code
  mounting --> armed: owner arms at final spot
  armed --> locked: moved / turned / cover opened / view changed / missed check-ins
  locked --> service: owner unlocks (15 min window)
  service --> armed: re-arm or window ends
  armed --> revoked: staff revoke
  locked --> revoked: staff revoke
